{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんこんにちは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おっさんレディーこと\n新内眞衣です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日のNOGIBINGO!3は\n見ていただいたでしょうか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/11/15/1560195/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさか1位になるとは\n思いませんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女子力あげます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/11/15/1560195/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも貝ひもはやめません！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/11/15/1560195/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/11/15/1560195/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カフェ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなりましたが、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何度目の青空か？カフェ in 丸の内\n無事に終了しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/11/15/1560195/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"約１か月間、\nたくさんの方々に来ていただき\n本当に嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"始まった頃は\nまだ絶賛アンダーライブ中。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"酷い時とかは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝カフェ行って\n昼OLやって\n夜アンダーライブ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みたいな感じで..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"多分誰よりも\nバタバタしていました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもね！だからこそ、\nカフェの良い感想とか聞けたり、\n今日の夜アンダーライブ行くよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか言ってくれたりするのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に嬉しかったし\nモチベーションに繋がって\nいたんだよ～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男性解禁になってからも、\n本当に多くの方が来てくれて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんのくつろいでいる姿を見て\nほっこりしてました(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まで、プロデュースなんて\nしたことなかったし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めてお話を聞いたときは\n人が来てくれるのか\n心配で堪らなかったけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せめて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/11/15/1560195/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれた人を\n後悔させないように、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/11/15/1560195/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"丸の内で働く人たちにもっと\n乃木坂４６を知ってもらえるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"という思いで頑張りました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お茶してくれた皆さん\n関わってくれたスタッフさん\n本当にありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/11/15/1560195/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな貴重な経験出来て\n幸せです！(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また機会があったらやりたいな～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/11/15/1560195/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/11/15/1560195/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎ天"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"下北沢チームの\nご褒美ロケ公開中です(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/11/15/1560195/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鎌倉～江の島\n本当に楽しい１日でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/11/15/1560195/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"海っていいね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この５人ってなんだか\nバランスいい気がする←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"下北チームに\n投票してくれた方"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"連れて行ってくれたのぎ天さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/11/15/1560195/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご褒美ロケだけど\n投票してくれた方々のために\n５人なりに頑張ったよん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/11/15/1560195/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/11/15/1560195/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私、パリといいご褒美ロケといい\n運良いな～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/11/15/1560195/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次はどんな地へ\n行けるんだろ～？？？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからものぎ天\nよろしくお願いします(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってことで！\n今日は長くなってしまったので\nこの辺でおじまいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/11/15/1560195/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒くなってきたから、\n風邪ひかないようにね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また更新します"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/11/15/1560195/0006.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}